# Mutation Operator SPI

When working under `docs/mutation-spi/` or `at.ac.tuwien.big.momot.spi.mutation`:

## Decisions (do not reopen without user ask)

1. TS cloud surface + separate evolutionary engine service.
2. Language-agnostic SPI; Henshin is an adapter.
3. Phased delivery; parity on test-suite before second backend.

## Rules

- Prefer implementing the **declared phase** only (`docs/mutation-spi/07-implementation-phases.md`).
- Keep SPI free of `org.eclipse.emf.henshin` types.
- Preserve Henshin search semantics when wrapping existing code.
- Do not push NSGA evaluate loops through Model Server.
- Update contract docs if you change SPI signatures.

